      "versionNonce": 73720174,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792439358936,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Tool calls are journaled before they run, so a\nresumed run never repeats a side effect.\n\n• Untrusted content (web, email, files, connector\noutput) only ever enters as a tool result.\n\n• Token budget per task and per day comes from\nHarnessConfig, never from code.\n\n• Auto-fix retries are capped; after that the user\ncan go back to the last working version.",
      "originalText": "• Tool calls are journaled before they run, so a\nresumed run never repeats a side effect.\n\n• Untrusted content (web, email, files, connector\noutput) only ever enters as a tool result.\n\n• Token budget per task and per day comes from\nHarnessConfig, never from code.\n\n• Auto-fix retries are capped; after that the user\ncan go back to the last working version.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
